I can't speak for others, but I'd read {ba'e pe'a} as something similar to
{je'u pe'a} as in "this is REALLY figurative, there is NO literal component
to what I'm saying".

Maybe used in one of those conversations like "so, a .... friend of mine is
having this problem..."

